    mor "一旦确定了群落中最强的雄性，我就要让他怀孕——！！等等，这个想法先搁置吧。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:290
translate chinese morriganroute1_0f11a103:

    # mor "[mc], if it isn’t my favorite surface dweller."
    mor "哟~，这不正是我最爱的地表居民，[mc]吗？"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:291
translate chinese morriganroute1_b47baf44:

    # mc "[mor]. Congratulations on… everything."
    mc "[mor]。恭喜你……拥有了这一切。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:293
translate chinese morriganroute1_7eac0b14:

    # mor "Charmed. And you brought friends?"
    mor "啧，你还带朋友来啦？"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:294
translate chinese morriganroute1_14b8fbe5:

    # mc "[lil], as you know, is a diplomat and student, and [but] is… [but]."
    mc "这位是[lil]，如你所知，是位外交官兼学生，而[but]是……[but]。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:297
translate chinese morriganroute1_61eb8eab:

    # lil "My pleasure."
    lil "不胜荣幸。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:303
translate chinese morriganroute1_fe19a845:

