    but "嗨-你好！"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:304
translate chinese morriganroute1_616d1408:

    # mor "The alchemist and the student. How quaint. Is your sister well, [but]?"
    mor "炼金术士与学生。这组合还挺古雅的哈。你妹妹还好吗，[but]？"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:306
translate chinese morriganroute1_ceae2287:

    # but "My... Huh?"
    but "我的....妹妹？"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:308
translate chinese morriganroute1_8669f6d6:

    # lil "She doesn't remember us at all..."
    lil "她根本就不记得我们...."

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:310
translate chinese morriganroute1_48b4efe0:

    # mor "There {i}were{/i} a lot of you."
    mor "因为你们马{i}太多{/i}了嘛"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:312
translate chinese morriganroute1_782a93b3:

    # mor "I doubt you’re here just to exchange pleasantries. What brings you to my humble domain?"
    mor "我看你们也不像是来我这拉家常玩的。何事令你们光临我这寒舍？"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:313
translate chinese morriganroute1_aa38e45a:

    # "I pulled the scroll from my satchel and held it out."
    "我从背包里抽出卷轴，高高举起。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:314
translate chinese morriganroute1_f6533023:

    # mc "A peace treaty. [aur] wants to end the animosity between Morphlings and the surface kingdom. She thinks it’s time to start fresh."
    mc "一份和平条约。[aur]希望终结幻形族与地表王国之间的敌对状态。她认为是时候放下过去，筑造未来了。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:316
translate chinese morriganroute1_ebc44856:

    # mor "[aur] wants peace? And she sent you to deliver her plea. I can’t say I’m surprised."
    mor "[aur]想要和平？还派你来传达她的请求。我怎么一点都不感到意外呢。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:317
translate chinese morriganroute1_e4131518:

    # "[mor] took the scroll, her sharp nails tracing the edges of the parchment as she unfurled it. She scanned the text."
    "[mor]接过卷轴，尖利的指甲沿着羊皮纸的边缘滑动，将卷轴徐徐展开，扫视着上面的文字。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:319
translate chinese morriganroute1_9aaded0f:

    # mor "This is… surprisingly earnest. Peace between our people. Cooperation, trade, unity… all very nice on paper."
    mor "这写的……意外地真诚。我们两国人民共同渴求着和平。合作、贸易、团结……写的挺好听的。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:320
translate chinese morriganroute1_ca5cd3a4:

    # "She paused, her gaze growing distant."
    "她顿了一下，目光变得深邃。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:321
translate chinese morriganroute1_84d7f5a1:

    # mc "What's wrong? Is something on your mind?"
    mc "怎么了？还有什么地方需要协商吗？"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:323
translate chinese morriganroute1_8a13f8e8:

    # mor "When I returned to my homeland, I expected chaos or rebellion. But what I found… was a council."
    mor "当我回到故土时，本以为会看到一片混乱的国家或者一个叛乱的政权。但迎接我的……竟是一个议会。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:324
translate chinese morriganroute1_ca87e821:

    # mc "A council?"
    mc "议会？"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:326
translate chinese morriganroute1_52c544b1:

    # mor "Yes. Formed in my absence. They ruled the city as best they could—kept it alive, if barely."
    mor "是的。在我被囚禁时形成的议会。他们竭尽所能统治着这座城市——勉强维持着它的生机。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:327
translate chinese morriganroute1_0b3932d6:

    # mor "But when I entered the Spire, there was no open defiance, no battle. Just a room full of leaders staring at the one they thought was long gone."
    mor "当我踏入Eidolon Spire时，没有反抗，也没有战斗。满室议会成员们只是凝视着那个他们以为早已消失的女王。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:329
translate chinese morriganroute1_cc6fc652:

    # lil "And what did you do?"
    lil "然后？"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:331
translate chinese morriganroute1_41fc01f6:

    # mor "What I didn’t do was take it by force, though it would’ve been easy. I had every right to crush them under my heel."
    mor "虽然我确实有能力杀了他们，夺回我的王座，但我并没有选择这么做。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:332
translate chinese morriganroute1_df98b3da:

    # mor "But then, I asked myself… what would that achieve? More fear? More dissent? No. If I wanted to be their queen, I had to prove I was worthy."
    mor "我问自己……我这样做顶个屁用？这只会助长更多的恐惧，进而助长更多的反抗。不能这么再干下去了。若我想成为他们的女王，就必须证明自己配得上这个位置。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:334
translate chinese morriganroute1_62061c92:

    # but "That’s… surprisingly noble. What happened next?"
    but "这个想法……意外地高尚。后来呢？"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:336
translate chinese morriganroute1_47b8fc5c:

    # mor "I presented my case. I told them what I had learned, and why I believed I could lead them better than anyone else. I didn’t expect much. But then, they deliberated. Hours turned into days. Finally, they voted."
    mor "我陈述了自己的主张，向他们阐述了所学所知，以及为何相信自己能比任何意见领袖都能更出色地领导他们。我本没抱太大期望。然而他们开始商议，数小时拖成了数日。最终，他们进行了民主投票。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:337
translate chinese morriganroute1_c42b05ac:

    # mc "And?"
    mc "然后？"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:339
translate chinese morriganroute1_0d79709d:

    # mor "I won by a single vote. One vote that decided whether I would reclaim the throne—or leave in exile."
    mor "我仅以一票之差获胜。这一票决定了我究竟是重登王位——还是流亡异乡。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:340
translate chinese morriganroute1_35931c04:

    # "She let out a quiet laugh, tinged with self-deprecation."
    "她轻笑一声，带着几分自嘲。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:342
translate chinese morriganroute1_b8b87a7b:

    # mor "It was humbling, to say the least. Nearly half of them didn’t want me as their queen."
    mor "说真的了，这很丢脸。他们中有近半数的比例根本不愿我成为他们的女王。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:343
translate chinese morriganroute1_e2d32b6e:

    # mor "They doubted me, perhaps rightly so. But I meant it when I said I wanted to do better—for all of them. Even those who didn’t believe in me."
    mor "他们自然也有怀疑我的理由。但我真心实意地说过，我想做得更好——为了所有人。即使那些不相信我的人。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:345
translate chinese morriganroute1_571e9c35:

    # but "That’s a true testament to how much you’ve changed."
    but "这确实证明了你真的有很大的改变。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:347
translate chinese morriganroute1_266082d9:

    # lil "But now you have to prove yourself to the half that didn’t vote for you?"
    lil "但现在你必须向那半数没投你票的群体证明自己？"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:349
translate chinese morriganroute1_3d10406e:

    # mor "Exactly. They’re my people, whether they trust me or not. I’ll show them through action, not just words."
    mor "没错。无论他们是否信任我，他们依然是我的子民。我会用我的行动证明我自己，而非空谈。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:350
translate chinese morriganroute1_02ab9ed1:

    # mor "That’s why this treaty matters. It’s one step toward a future where we don’t just survive—we thrive."
    mor "这就是这项条约意义所在。它标志着我们迈向一个不仅求生存、更求繁荣的未来。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:352
translate chinese morriganroute1_8de9acec:

    # "She straightened her posture, the queenly confidence returning to her tone."
    "她挺直了身子，那份女王般的自信重新回到了她的语调里。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:353
translate chinese morriganroute1_347b974b:

    # mor "However, this treaty doesn’t erase my decades of imprisonment, my suffering. I don't want to sign this."
    mor "然而，这份条约无法抹去我数十年的囚禁与苦难。我依然拒绝签署它。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:354
translate chinese morriganroute1_dd71fae8:

    # mor "But, I'm not signing this for myself. I’ve had to swallow my pride many times in the face of a better future."
    mor "但个人行为无法上升到群体。这份条约的目的是为了我们两国共同的、美好的未来。而我也早已习惯了舍弃我个人的自尊来换取些什么。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:356
translate chinese morriganroute1_50eceb4c:

    # "She stopped herself, her jaw tightening. Doubts, perhaps?"
    "她猛地止住动作，下颌紧绷。是怀疑吗？"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:357
translate chinese morriganroute1_4e9dedbf:

    # mc "This is a chance to move forward. To rebuild."
    mc "这不仅是我们共同前进的机会，也是共同重建的机会。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:358
translate chinese morriganroute1_2ec7486b:

    # "[mor] tilted her head, the green slits in her eyes narrowing slightly."
    "[mor]歪了歪头，绿色而又细长的双眼微微眯起。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:360
translate chinese morriganroute1_03df9f61:

    # mor "Oh, I’ll rebuild. Make no mistake about that. It’ll take time, yes, but Eidolon Spire will rise again. Still…"
    mor "哦，我会自己重建的。这一点毋庸置疑。Eidolon Spire终将重现它的往日荣光，只不过需要点时间而已。然而……"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:364
translate chinese morriganroute1_7ef65c34:

