    "她让这个词在空气中回荡，转头看向了[lil]和[but]，打量着她们。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:367
translate chinese morriganroute1_5cff69e1:

    # mor "I’ll consider signing this treaty… But only on one condition."
    mor "我会考虑签署这项条约……但有一个条件。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:368
translate chinese morriganroute1_0545e2fd:

    # "Stepping closer, her gaze locked onto mine, then flicked to the girls."
    "她走近一步，目光锁定在我身上，随即扫向那两个女孩。"

