translate chinese morriganroute1_c444ac10:

    # mor "You… Will assist me in ensuring the prosperity of my people."
    mor "你们……将协助我确保我的子民繁荣昌盛。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:371
translate chinese morriganroute1_72c1395f:

