    mor "强健的、拥有更强大的血脉的子嗣。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:379
translate chinese morriganroute1_2f67abf0:

    # mor "My people have suffered too many losses. If peace is to work, we need numbers. Power."
    mor "我的子民们承受了太多的损失。若要和平真正生效，我们需要数量上的优势。需要力量。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:380
translate chinese morriganroute1_151bd0ec:

    # mor "And as Queen, it falls to me to ensure our survival by any means necessary."
    mor "身为女王，我必须不惜一切代价确保我们的生存。"

