    mor "再让[mc]在你们的体内完成受精，你们便会成为孕育下一代幻形灵的完美载体。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:395
translate chinese morriganroute1_fe76d59b:

    # "[lil]’s eyes widened, but she quickly regained her composure, standing tall."
    "[lil]的眼睛顿时瞪得老大，但她很快镇定下来，挺直了身子。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:396
translate chinese morriganroute1_681dcb66:

