# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:399
translate chinese morriganroute1_b345d81f:

    # mor "Smart girl. Yes, it’s symbolic as much as practical. A true melding of our kingdoms. And if you agree, I’ll sign this treaty without hesitation."
    mor "你这姑娘还挺聪明的。是的，这既有象征性，也有实际性。是我们两国真正的融合。如果你同意，我将毫不犹豫地签署这份条约。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:400
translate chinese morriganroute1_2d58ae23:

    # "All eyes turned to me. It was clear this decision wasn’t just political—it was deeply personal for everyone involved."
    "所有人的目光都转向了我。很明显，这个决定不仅关乎政治——对在场的三匹马之间都有重大的意义。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:401
translate chinese morriganroute1_eff7c78c:

    # mc "You’re asking for a lot, [mor]… And I can see why this means so much to you."
    mc "你的条件有点过分了，[mor]……不过我也明白它的重要性。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:402
translate chinese morriganroute1_44ad7298:

    # "[mor]’s smirk softened into something almost sincere."
    "[mor]的冷笑渐渐软化，变得真诚起来。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:403
translate chinese morriganroute1_2996d4f3:

    # mor "Consider it an investment for a future where our people stand united."
    mor "请将其视为一项投资，投资于我们子民的未来。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:414
translate chinese morriganroute1_c549b65d:

    # lil "Ah, but… You were supposed to say no!"
    lil "啊，但是……你怎么能接受这种条件啊！"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:417
