    lil "唉……为了国家，我真是.....唉……"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:423
translate chinese morriganroute1_a1797a2e:

    # "[lil] bends over beside [but], her back arching to push out her tight butt. Green precum oozed from the tip of [mor]’s cock as it swayed backwards and forwards between the girls, deciding which to take first."
    "[lil]俯身立在[but]身侧，将紧致的臀部高高翘起。[mor]的肉棒在女孩们之间来回摆动，绿色的先走汁从顶端渗出，犹豫着先插哪一个比较好。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:424
translate chinese morriganroute1_22f3d8aa:

