    "[lil]清了清嗓子，努力保持着外交家的从容姿态。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:598
translate chinese morriganroute1_6c6a12d6:

    # lil "The treaty isn’t just about preventing war, Queen [mor]. It’s about fostering trade and rebuilding after the darkness. Both our nations have suffered, and this agreement is a step toward mutual healing."
    lil "女王陛下，这份条约不仅只是为了我们两国之间可能的战争，更在于促进两国间的贸易往来与后永夜时代的重建。我们两国都曾饱受创伤，而这份协议正是迈向相互帮扶的第一步。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:600
translate chinese morriganroute1_0c969a50:

    # mor "Oh, mutual healing. How noble. Very well, trade your precious goods and play nice with my people. Just don’t expect a thank-you card."
    mor "哦，相互帮扶，多么崇高的想法啊。挺好的，拿你们珍贵的货物来交易，好好和我的人民打交道。但别指望会收到我的感谢卡就是了。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:601
translate chinese morriganroute1_45f45e63:

    # "I tucked the treaty into my satchel, offering her a small, sincere smile."
    "我把条约塞进背包里，朝她露出一个微小而真诚的微笑。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:602
translate chinese morriganroute1_971df861:

    # mc "For what it’s worth, [mor], I do hope your reign goes well. The Morphlings need a strong leader to guide them, and you’ve already proven you’re more than capable."
    mc "我祝福你，[mor]，我真心希望你能好好的管理你的国家。幻形灵们确实需要一位强大的领袖来指引方向，而你也早已证明自己能完全胜任这一位置。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:604
translate chinese morriganroute1_45fd67a4:

    # mor "Oh, it’ll go well. I’ll make sure of that."
    mor "哦，我会的。我会确保一切都重回正轨的。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:605
translate chinese morriganroute1_fc10c246:

    # "She turned toward a nearby attendant, her voice booming with renewed energy."
    "她转向附近的一名侍从，声音里又焕发出了新的活力。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:607
translate chinese morriganroute1_5556d55a:

    # mor "Gossamer! Send in a broodmare! I have some eggs to unload."
    mor "蛛丝！再去找一匹受体过来！我要排卵了."

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:616
translate chinese morriganroute1_bdd6b1fd:

    # lil "Ehhh… let’s… just get out of here before we hear anything else."
    lil "呃……我们……赶紧离开这吧，免得再听到什么不该听的。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:620
translate chinese morriganroute1_86eceb28:

    # but "Finally leaving? Phew..."
    but "终于要走了？呼……"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:622
translate chinese morriganroute1_23c81387:

    # "As we made our way back through the halls of the castle. The Morphling guards offered respectful nods as we passed, their glow-in-the-dark eyes tracking our every move."
    "我们穿过了城堡的走廊，幻形灵守卫们向我们抬头示敬，发着夜光的双眼紧盯着我们。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:626
translate chinese morriganroute1_1826a2ed:

    # "Once we stepped into the open air, the cool breeze was a welcome relief."
    "一踏出洞穴，凉风拂面，令人倍感舒畅。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:629
translate chinese morriganroute1_e8d0c5bc:

    # lil "Well, that was... productive, I guess."
    lil "嗯，这算是……挺有成效的吧。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:632
translate chinese morriganroute1_9d1bde37:

    # but "Come on, admit it—you were a little impressed. That woman’s got spirit."
    but "别装了，承认吧——你确实有点佩服她。那女的确实很有魄力。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:633
translate chinese morriganroute1_4636c4a8:

    # mc "She’s certainly… unique. At least the treaty’s signed. That’s what matters."
    mc "她确实……与众不同。至少我们把和平条约签了，不是吗？这才是关键。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:635
translate chinese morriganroute1_6478c1a9:

    # lil "I'm going back to the castle, so I’ll deliver the signed treaty to [aur] for you. You’ve earned a break after that."
    lil "我这就回城堡，把签好的和平条约交给[aur]。你们先回去好好休息了吧。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:637
translate chinese morriganroute1_c2fb0271:

    # but "Yeah, rest up! You’ve been dealing with enough queens for one day."
    but "是啊，你回去好好休息吧！今天见的女王已经够多了。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:641
translate chinese morriganroute1_4813eb49:

    # "Our ride back continued to my place, letting me lean back and just enjoy the view."
    "我们坐上了汽车，启程回家。终于，我得以靠在了软椅上，静静欣赏着沿途的风景"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:642
translate chinese morriganroute1_94154834:

    # "Despite the chaos and [mor]’s antics, there was a strange sense of hope in the air. The world was slowly piecing itself back together."
    "尽管混乱四起，[mor]又重归了她的王座，但空气中却弥漫着一种奇特的希望气息。世界正缓缓地重新拼凑起来。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:647
translate chinese morriganroute1_49ac8de6:

    # "The throne room of Eidolon Spire had grown quiet. [mor] lounged back in her obsidian throne, one leg crossed over the other, inspecting her nails with idle disinterest."
    "Eidolon Spire的王座厅内陷入了寂静。[mor]斜倚在黑曜石王座上，双腿交叠，漫不经心地端详着自己的指甲。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:648
translate chinese morriganroute1_a201f645:

    # mor "How am I already bored? *{i}Sigh{/i}* The kingdom is running itself fine even without me."
    mor "我怎么这么快就觉得无聊了？*{i}唉{/i}*看来，就算没有我，这个国家也能正常运转。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:651
translate chinese morriganroute1_3ef6f242:

    # "A soft shimmer of magic rippled through the air, a distortion forming near the chamber’s entrance. From the shadows, a figure emerged."
    "空气中泛起一抹柔和的魔法能量，扭曲了入口处的空间。一道身影从阴影中浮现。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:654
translate chinese morriganroute1_e82cb20c:

    # mor "Well, well. What do we have here? You’re either very brave or very foolish to enter uninvited."
    mor "哎呀呀，这是什么情况呀？有什么东西未经邀请就闯了进来，这马要么是胆大包天，要么是愚不可及。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:655
translate chinese morriganroute1_caacab64:

    # "The figure stepped closer, his footsteps echoing against the crystalline floor."
    "那马走近几步，脚步声在晶莹剔透的地板上回荡。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:659
translate chinese morriganroute1_98fa6172:

    # um "I’d like to congratulate you on reclaiming your throne, Queen [mor]."
    um "谨此祝贺您重登王位，[mor]女王陛下。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:661
translate chinese morriganroute1_33cee469:

    # mor "Oh, spare me the dramatics, darling. If you’ve come to grovel, get in line. I’m terribly busy ruling my people."
    mor "噢，别在我面前耍这套把戏，亲爱的。若你来此是为了向我表达臣服的话，排队去吧。我正忙着统治我的子民呢。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:662
translate chinese morriganroute1_d8d3bfba:

    # um "I have come to propose a... partnership."
    um "我前来是为了提议建立...一个盟约。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:664
translate chinese morriganroute1_50cb8d91:

    # mor "Another peace treaty? I'm popular today."
    mor "又来？今天我可真是受欢迎。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:665
translate chinese morriganroute1_caafc031:

    # um "Your people are strong, yes, but even strength has its limits. And I suspect your ambitions extend beyond the confines of this glowing pit."
    um "您的子民确实强大，但即便是力量也有其极限。而我怀疑，你们的野心早已超越了这片发光深渊的疆界。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:666
translate chinese morriganroute1_3c02597d:

    # "Her eyes narrowed, and she leaned forward, resting her chin on her hand."
    "她眯起眼睛，身体前倾，将下巴托在了手上。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:668
translate chinese morriganroute1_60493b0b:

    # mor "Careful, stranger. My patience is thin, and flattery only goes so far. Who are you, and why should I care?"
    mor "小心点，陌生人。我的耐心所剩无几，拍马屁也对我没什么用。你究竟是谁，我又有什么理由要听你的话？"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:670
translate chinese morriganroute1_cac2a752:

    # um "I am [um], rightful ruler of Arcadia’s underbelly and master of shadow."
    um "我乃[um]，Arcadia暗影世界的合法统治者，亦是阴影之主。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:672
translate chinese morriganroute1_fa04ca8e:

    # mor "[um]? {i}That{/i} King [um]? You’re far from the saintly unicorn I expected…"
    mor "[um]？{i}那位{/i}国王[um]？你远非我所知的那匹圣洁角马……"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:674
translate chinese morriganroute1_48cf3826:

    # um "So you’re aware of my history? Good. I need your help."
    um "所以您了解我的过去？这是好事。我需要您的帮助。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:676
translate chinese morriganroute1_f95db104:

    # "[mor] tilted her head, her lips curling into a sly smirk."
    "[mor]歪了歪头，嘴角勾起一抹狡黠的微笑。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:677
translate chinese morriganroute1_92fcf961:

    # mor "Help? From little old me? How intriguing. Go on."
    mor "帮助？还是我这样的小人物？真有意思。继续说。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:679
translate chinese morriganroute1_32b66f2c:

    # um "Arcadia. The shining jewel of the surface world. A bastion of corruption ruled by [aur] and [sel]. I intend to save it."
    um "Arcadia。地表世界的璀璨明珠。由[aur]与[sel]统治的腐败堡垒。我将拯救它。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:681
translate chinese morriganroute1_fe0c3b9b:

    # mor "And you think I’d join your little vendetta because…?"
    mor "你有什么理由会认为我会加入你的报复行动……？"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:683
translate chinese morriganroute1_cb57850c:

    # um "Because Arcadia has long stood in the way of your people’s prosperity. Its rulers view Morphlings as little more than monsters—dangerous, expendable. Peace treaty or not, they will never accept you as an equal."
    um "因为Arcadia始终阻碍着您的族人的繁荣。其统治者视你族危险且可有可无。无论是否和你们签订和平条约，他们永远不会视你们为平等的伙伴。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:685
translate chinese morriganroute1_d759a900:

    # mor "Go on."
    mor "继续说。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:687
translate chinese morriganroute1_e3688226:

    # um "I don’t seek to control you, Queen [mor]. I seek an alliance—a convergence of our strengths. Together, we could dismantle their throne and carve out a future where that Queen’s ‘light’ no longer casts a shadow over us."
    um "我并非要掌控你，[mor]女王。我寻求的是一个联盟——一个无可比拟的强大联盟。携手并肩，我们能推翻他们的统治，开创一个不再被那位女王的“光芒”笼罩的未来。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:689
translate chinese morriganroute1_e4d900f3:

    # mor "Hmm. A poetic little speech, I’ll give you that. But why would I risk what I’ve built here for your revenge fantasy?"
    mor "呵。我不得不承认，你这话说的还挺高尚的。但凭什么我要为你的复仇幻想，冒险毁掉我在此刚刚建立的一切？"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:691
translate chinese morriganroute1_aee27624:

    # um "Because even queens need allies. And because I’m offering you more than vengeance—I’m offering you power."
    um "因为强大如您，也需要盟友。而且我带给你的不仅是复仇——还有权力。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:692
translate chinese morriganroute1_f38fbf4f:

    # um "Imagine Eidolon Spire not as an underground sanctuary, but as the heart of a vast empire. A realm where your people can thrive without fear, without limitation."
    um "想象一下，Eidolon Spire并非只是地下的圣所，而是成为了广袤帝国的心脏。一片阳光下的土地，能让您的子民得以无忧无虑地蓬勃发展的国度。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:694
translate chinese morriganroute1_e79046a2:

    # "[mor]’s eyes gleamed, her fingers drumming lightly against the armrest of her throne."
    "[mor]的眼睛闪着绿光，尖利的指甲轻敲着王座的扶手。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:695
translate chinese morriganroute1_4e6a4741:

    # mor "Interesting. But you haven’t answered the most important question."
    mor "有意思。但你还没回答最重要的问题。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:697
translate chinese morriganroute1_8799a25e:

    # um "Which is?"
    um "哪一个问题？"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:699
translate chinese morriganroute1_749ce479:

    # mor "What do you really want from me, Umbra? Power? Influence? Or something far more dangerous?"
    mor "你究竟想要我帮你什么，Umbra？权力？影响力？还是某种更危险的东西？"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:700
translate chinese morriganroute1_633fb5bd:

    # "Umbra’s smile was faint but unnerving, his piercing eyes locking onto hers."
    "Umbra的笑容虽浅，却令人十分不安，他锐利的目光牢牢锁定在了她的身上。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:701
translate chinese morriganroute1_e585a6cc:

    # um "That, my dear queen, is for you to decide."
    um "亲爱的女王陛下，这由您来决定。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:703
translate chinese morriganroute1_5ba95ba5:

    # "The room fell into a tense silence, the only sound the faint underground ambience."
    "房间陷入了紧张的寂静，唯有微弱的水滴声在屋内回荡。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:705
translate chinese morriganroute1_8a0aa1bd:

    # "Finally, she leaned back, a wicked grin spreading across her face."
    "最后，她向后靠去，脸上浮现出一抹狡黠的笑容。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:706
translate chinese morriganroute1_3da41f2e:

    # mor "Well, Umbra… you certainly know how to make an entrance. Let’s just say I’m… intrigued."
    mor "嗯，Umbra……你这登场方式还挺有创造力的。这么说吧，我……颇感兴趣。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:707
translate chinese morriganroute1_08159cc0:

    # um "You're a wise woman. I’ll await your decision."
    um "您真是位明智的女士。我将静候您的决定。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:710
translate chinese morriganroute1_f0bae131:

    # "With that, he turned, disappearing back into the shadows as swiftly as he had arrived. [mor] tapped her chin thoughtfully, her smirk lingering."
    "话音未落，他就如来时那般迅疾，转身消失在了阴影之中。[mor]若有所思地轻叩着她的下巴，戏谑的笑容仍未散去。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:712
translate chinese morriganroute1_255868db:

    # mor "An empire, hmm? How delightfully tempting…"
    mor "一个更伟大的帝国，唔？多么令人心动啊……"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:714
translate chinese morriganroute1_5f4437c0:

    # "Back at the city, it was just turning night time. I still have time to do something else."
    "我们在黄昏时分回到了城里。看来我还有时间做点别的事情。"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:727
translate chinese shoptut_fd28dc70:

    # "Welcome to the shop! Now with instant magical deliveries to your door!"
    "欢迎来到商店！现在您可以享受神奇的即刻送货服务！"

# game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:728
translate chinese shoptut_097531d2:

    # "Purchase an item once, and you'll unlock it for all applicable scenes and characters!"
    "购买一次物品，您就可以在所有适用的场景和角色那解锁该物品！"

translate chinese strings:

    # game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:104
    old "Ohhh yeah!"
    new "哦——耶！"

    # game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:104
    old "H-Hang on. Don't you think we're going too far?"
    new "等-等一下。你不觉得我们做得有点上头了吗？"

    # game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:405
    old "Accept the Terms"
    new "接受这些条款哟～"

    # game/4.9 - Misc.rpy:405
    old "Refuse, Obviously"
    new "拒绝！"

